    dp = [0] * (n + 1) 
    dp[1] = k 
    dp[2] = k * (k - 1) + k  # Corrected formula for 2 posts
    for i in range(3, n + 1): 
        dp[i] = ((k - 1) * (dp[i - 1] + dp[i - 2])) % 1000000007
    return dp[n]
```

